@startuml observation-split-seq
' 典型消费者：serve-dashboard.ts 的 buildDashboardSnapshot（读过 serve-dashboard.ts:1773-1811 的取数顺序）。
' 简化：真实代码经 readDashboardSystem/ManagerLight/Live 三个包装函数，它们在 serve-dashboard 里还有各自的缓存，此处省略。
' 经过提议结构：消费者仍 import observation.ts（barrel），调用落到各模块。未渲染校验。
title buildDashboardSnapshot through the proposed observation modules

participant "serve-dashboard.ts\nbuildDashboardSnapshot" as D
participant "observation.ts\n(barrel)" as B
participant "observation-system" as SYS
participant "observation-exec" as EX
participant "observation-tests" as T
participant "observation-live" as L
participant "observation-run-liveness" as RL
participant "observation-worker-runtime" as WR
participant "observation-outcomes" as OC
participant "observation-task-at-ref" as TAR
participant "observation-repo" as R
participant "ttl-cache.ts" as C

note over D
  readLive is called with computeBlocking:false
  (serve-dashboard.ts:1594), so observation-blocking
  is not on this path.
end note

D -> B : readSystem(root) and readManagerLight(root)\nstarted first, not awaited yet
B -> SYS : (re-export, no logic)
SYS -> EX : runPluginScript(resource-gate, process-budget)
SYS -> EX : runPluginScript(loop-driver-check)
SYS -> C : driverStatusCache.get(root)
note right of SYS
  dynamic import of the driver kernel stays here:
  the "no static plugin import" rule is local to this module
end note

D -> D : await yieldToEventLoop()
D -> B : readTestsNonBlocking(root)
B -> T : (re-export)
T -> C : verificationRoundCache.get(root)
alt miss
  T -> T : read .quay/verification-round.jsonl in chunks
  T -> C : set(root, result)
end
T --> D : TestsResult

D -> D : await yieldToEventLoop()
D -> B : readLive(root, {computeBlocking:false})
B -> L : (re-export)
L -> L : pairInFlight(events)
L -> RL : runProcessAliveSync / taskWorktreeOpen
L -> OC : readWorkerOutcomeText + parseWorkerOutcomeRecords
L -> WR : round tasks, /proc worker scan, driver online/active
WR -> OC : readWorkerOutcomeText
L -> TAR : readTaskStatusForLive(root, task)
TAR -> C : peek / get status map at develop
L -> WR : fan-in lock + suite state, deriveInFlightPhase
L --> D : LiveResult

D -> D : await yieldToEventLoop()
D -> B : readGitHistory(root)
B -> R : (re-export)
R -> C : gitHistoryCache.get(key)
R --> D : GitHistoryResult
D -> B : readCurrentSuiteRun(root)
B -> WR : (re-export)
WR --> D : CurrentSuiteRun
D -> B : readWorkerOutcomeRecords(root)
B -> OC : (re-export)
OC --> D : WorkerOutcomeRecord[]

SYS --> D : SystemResult and ManagerResult (awaited last)
@enduml
